:110px;vertical-align:top;\">Hora</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">21:00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;width:110px;vertical-align:top;\">Personas</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">4 personas</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;width:110px;vertical-align:top;\">Sala</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">Terraza</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;width:110px;vertical-align:top;\">Notas</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#111827;font-weight:600;\">Cumpleaños, trona para bebé</td>\n  </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\">\n      Si necesitas hacer algún cambio o cancelar tu reserva, puedes usar el botón a continuación:\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\">\n      <a href=\"http://localhost:3005/public/cancel?reservationId=res1&token=tok123\"\n         style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:#3B82F6;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;\">\n        Cancelar mi reserva\n      </a>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\">\n      <strong>Contacto del restaurante:</strong><br>\n      Email: hola@labrasserie.test<br>Teléfono: +34 600 000 000\n    </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#f9fafb;padding:16px 32px 20px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;text-align:center;\">\n                Este correo ha sido generado automáticamente, por favor no respondas a este mensaje.\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#d1d5db;text-align:center;\">\n                Powered by <a href=\"https://vetrareserve.com\" style=\"color:#7C3AED;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Vetra</a>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
      }
    }
  ],
